    "title": "Mono to Stereo Pan",
    "author": "groovy",
    "description": "Fold to mono, then equal-power Pan into stereo (layout-agnostic panner). Optional ControlCurve drives pan over time. No AI models.",
    "tags": [
      "pan",
      "stereo",
      "dsp",
      "modular",
      "featured"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-09-20T20:40:00Z",
